#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio.rst:5
msgid "Folio properties"
msgstr "图幅属性"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio.rst:7
msgid ""
"At QElectroTech, the `folio properties`_ can be common at all `folios`_ from"
" the same `project`_. QElectroTech also allows that each `folio`_ has its "
"own properties. For example, two `folios`_ from the same project will have "
"the same size and title block but they can be created by different authors "
"or they can have different revision."
msgstr ""
"在 QElectroTech 中， `图幅属性 <folio properties_>`_ 可以对同一 `项目 <project_>`_ 的所有 `图幅"
" <folios_>`_ 通用。QElectroTech 也允许每个 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 拥有自己的属性。例如，同一项目的两个 `图幅 "
"<folios_>`_ 可以具有相同的尺寸和图框，但可由不同的作者创建，或具有不同的修订版本。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio.rst:12
msgid ""
"To increase the working efficiency, QElectroTech provides the option to "
"storage at the project Data some `project properties`_ pre-defined by the "
"user. This feature allows the user avoiding to define many `folio "
"properties`_ each time that the user `creates new folio`_ inside the "
"`project`_."
msgstr ""
"为了提高工作效率，QElectroTech 提供了将用户预定义的一些 `项目属性 <project properties_>`_ "
"存储到项目数据中的选项。此功能让用户在 `项目 <project_>`_ 中每次 `创建新图幅 <creates new folio_>`_ "
"时，无需重复定义大量 `图幅属性 <folio properties_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio.rst:18
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows defining automatically `folio properties`_ during "
"`project creation`_. For more information about how to standardize some "
"`folio properties`_ from `project`_ to `project`_, please refers to the "
"`QElectroTech folio settings`_ section."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许在 `项目创建 <project creation_>`_ 期间自动定义 `图幅属性 <folio "
"properties_>`_ 。有关如何让某些 `图幅属性 <folio properties_>`_ 从一个 `项目 <project_>`_ "
"到另一个 `项目 <project_>`_ 保持统一的更多信息，请参阅 `QElectroTech 图幅设置 <QElectroTech folio "
"settings_>`_ 一节。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio.rst:22
msgid ""
"The **Folio** tab from **New folio** settings section allows pre-defining "
"some `folio properties`_:"
msgstr "**新建图幅** 设置部分中的 **图幅** 标签页允许预先定义一些 `图幅属性 <folio properties_>`_ ："

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio.rst:24
msgid "`Folio size`_."
msgstr "`图幅尺寸 <Folio size_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio.rst:25
msgid "`Folio title block`_."
msgstr "`图幅图框 <Folio title block_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio.rst:26
msgid "`Folio default variables values`_."
msgstr "`图幅默认变量值 <Folio default variables values_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio.rst:27
msgid "`Folio user variables`_."
msgstr "`图幅用户变量 <Folio user variables_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio.rst:32
msgid "Figure: Project folio properties window"
msgstr "图：项目图幅属性窗口"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio.rst:34
msgid "To define folio properties:"
msgstr "要定义图幅属性："

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio.rst:36
msgid "`Display`_ project properties PopUP window."
msgstr "`显示 <Display_>`_ 项目属性弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio.rst:37
msgid "Go to **New folio** section."
msgstr "转到 **新建图幅** 部分。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio.rst:38
msgid "Go to **Folio** tab."
msgstr "转到 **图幅** 标签页。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio.rst:39
msgid "Define the desired parameters for each field."
msgstr "为每个字段设置所需的参数。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio.rst:40
msgid ""
"Press **OK** button to save the configuration changes and close project "
"properties PopUP window."
msgstr "按 **OK** 按钮保存配置更改并关闭项目属性弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/folio.rst:44
msgid ""
"All pre-defined `folio properties`_ at `project properties`_ will be "
"automatically defined during `folio creation`_ at `folio properties`_."
msgstr ""
"在 `项目属性 <project properties_>`_ 中预定义的所有 `图幅属性 <folio properties_>`_ ，都会在 "
"`图幅创建 <folio creation_>`_ 时自动填入 `图幅属性 <folio properties_>`_ 。"
